sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 User
    participant CS  as Content Script
    participant SW  as Service Worker
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant LLM as Ollama (LLM)
    participant EMB as Ollama (Embeddings)
    participant VDB as ChromaDB
    participant DB  as SQLite
    participant NM  as Chrome Notifications

    User->>CS: Types conversation text
    CS->>CS: MutationObserver fires
    CS->>CS: Debounce (3s)
    CS->>CS: SecurityFilter.sanitize()
    CS->>SW: CONTEXT_UPDATE {source, text}

    SW->>SW: Check snooze / rate limit
    SW->>SW: Load user settings
    SW->>API: POST /api/v1/recommend

    par AI Analysis (parallel)
        API->>LLM: Detect emotion
        LLM-->>API: {emotion, confidence, reason}
    and
        API->>LLM: Classify context
        LLM-->>API: {context, confidence}
    and
        API->>LLM: Detect intent
        LLM-->>API: {intent}
    end

    API->>DB: Load user memory
    DB-->>API: {liked_songs, preferred_genres, ...}

    API->>EMB: embed_query(emotion, context, intent, genres)
    EMB-->>API: query_vector[768]

    API->>VDB: query(vector, top_k=20)
    VDB-->>API: candidate_songs[]

    API->>API: HybridScorer.score_all()
    Note over API: emotion×0.4 + context×0.25<br/>+ intent×0.15 + history×0.2

    API->>API: YouTubeService.build_url()
    API->>DB: record_recommendation(user_id, song_id)
    API-->>SW: RecommendResponse{recommendation, emotion, context, intent}

    SW->>SW: StorageService.addRecommendation()
    SW->>NM: NotificationManager.show()
    NM->>User: 🎵 Chrome Notification

    alt User clicks Play
        User->>NM: [▶ Play Song]
        NM->>SW: FEEDBACK {action: "play"}
        SW->>API: POST /api/v1/feedback
        API->>DB: UPDATE genre_scores
        NM->>User: Opens YouTube tab
    else User clicks Like
        User->>NM: [👍 Like]
        NM->>SW: FEEDBACK {action: "like"}
        SW->>API: POST /api/v1/feedback
        API->>DB: liked_songs += song_id
        API->>DB: genre_scores[genre] += 1.0
    else User clicks Dislike
        User->>NM: [👎 Dislike]
        NM->>SW: FEEDBACK {action: "dislike"}
        SW->>API: POST /api/v1/feedback
        API->>DB: disliked_songs += song_id
    else User clicks Snooze
        User->>NM: [Snooze]
        NM->>SW: SNOOZE {minutes: 60}
        SW->>SW: chrome.alarms.create()
        SW->>SW: setSnoozeUntil(timestamp)
    end
